  "details": "The solution that render an astronomical number(>10000) of meshes is DrawMeshInstancedIndirect.\n\nDrawMeshInstanced is useless in this situation. It can batching only 1023 Mesh.\n\nToday, \"TestPilots\" is pretty popular in VRChat.\n\nBut that world has no trees.\n\nIf place trees enough density(1km*1km with 8m²/tree => 125000 trees), we cannot avoid performance problem.",
